---
/**
 * PageBox — the single contained frame for the homepage.
 * Owns the ONLY border used for separation. Direct children (sticky HeroBar →
 * section bands → sticky Footer) separate via 1px flex gaps that expose this
 * box's line-colored background. Everything inside is borderless.
 */
---
<div class="page-box"><slot /></div>
<style>
  .page-box {
    max-width: var(--maxw);
    margin: 0 auto;
    min-height: 100%;
    box-sizing: border-box;
    background: var(--line);
    border: 1px solid var(--line);
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 1px;
  }
</style>
